libssh2.js local wrapper patch

The generated wrapper must export two pointer-safe helpers:

  ssh2_sftp_rename_ex(sftp, source, source_len, dest, dest_len, flags)
  ssh2_sftp_posix_rename_ex(sftp, source, source_len, dest, dest_len)

Both helpers call the corresponding libssh2 SFTP APIs and preserve the native
return code. The checked-in dist is used by normal PWA builds; CI rebuilds this
patch with Emscripten and compares the resulting SHA-256.
